{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"21597","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v16742","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"のり太","creatorId":"vndb:s1161","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:1462","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1161","name":"のり太","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:145430","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"嵩夜あや(由比雅雪)","creatorId":"vndb:s1162","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:1181","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1162","name":"嵩夜あや(由比雅雪)","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:145431","source":"egs"}],"music":[],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c18494","characterName":"神尾 愛生","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"25395","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"97551"}],"egsCharacterIds":["3583"],"vndbCharacterId":"c18494"},"originalCharacterName":"神尾 愛生","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"410"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"87"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"E"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"154"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ami is the new transfer student to Reiji's class who immediately catched everyone's attention on her first day. Reiji's head warns this girl to be dangerous, and she indeed is: Ami is very cunning and seems to be always one step ahead of others. She often compares herself to a devil. Ami blackmails Reiji in order to use him, a very popular student with lots of information on many powerful people in his school, to turn everyone in the school into her “comrades”. Everything for the sake of her ultimate goal: To kill her uncle and go free of any suspect. For that end, she must become the most influent person in school."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Calculative at best and deceitful at worst, Kamio Ami is the brightest star and biggest mystery in this game. Armed with manipulation techniques commonly known to salesman and cons artist, she often makes her classmates dance to her tune without even realizing it. While that makes Ami sound like an evil controlling bitch, it is important to know that her concept of \"right\" and \"wrong\" is pretty twisted to begin with. In other words, for most of the time, this red-haired \"devil\" is simply acting out of either curiosity or playfulness. The outcome of her whimsical actions can be so significant that they completely change someone's life."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from gangrelion's review and aquaspirit39's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c18494"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"転校生。自らを悪魔と称して、人の心を読み、人を操る。陽気な性格で、傍若無人に振る舞うかと思えば、家庭的なところもあり、複雑な個性を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"対人関係や、他人の機微というものに敏感で、ぼんやりとした心の中のイメージを理数的な感覚に変換することが得意。その計算高さは並外れている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、それ以外の部分では割と普通の性格をしていて、可愛いものを欲しがる、他人とのコミュニケーションを楽しむ、といった面もしっかりと存在している。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3583","sourceWorkId":"20269","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"転校生。 自らを悪魔と称し、人の心を読み、人を操る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"結果だけを見ると確かに悪魔のように思えるが、実際に超常的な力でそれを引き起こしているわけではない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"陽気な性格で、性に対してもフランク。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身体を武器に玲児の家に居候を決め込み、傍若無人に振る舞うかと思えば、家事を肩代わりしたり玲児を労ったりと家庭的なところもあり、どうにもよく判らない部分が存在する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「それなら、自分の取引ディールには自分の資産を使う。 危険リスクは全部……わたしが背負う」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacte